hifiberry-sendspin (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * postinst: restart config-server when it is running so a post-boot install
    (e.g. via hbos-full) is picked up and the WebUI can start the player. Fixes
    "can't be started in the UI" after apt-installing onto a running system.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Wed, 08 Jul 2026 18:00:00 +0000

hifiberry-sendspin (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Sendspin player daemon for Music Assistant.
    - player/controller/metadata roles via sendspin-cpp
    - ALSA default-device output; ALSA mixer volume (both directions)
    - pushes now-playing metadata + cover art to audiocontrol
    - reports the audio stream format (codec/sample rate/bit depth) to
      audiocontrol
    - transport command endpoint (127.0.0.1:3547) and mDNS advertisement

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Wed, 08 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
